Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 00:31:49 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] unit B-7-terminal-suggest: edits

Drop the references to terminalContrib/suggest from the terminal exports, the initial hint, the accessibility help and the extension API. Terminal completion providers from extensions are accepted and never asked.
